---
args: { scope: DisputeScope, questions: DispositiveQuestionSet, evidence: QuestionEvidenceLedger, disposition: ConditionalDisposition, pages: EvidencePage[] }
returns: BalancedDossierAssembly
---
Assemble both parties' relevant positions, cited evidence, conditional reasoning, response windows and appeal path. Redact unnecessary personal data while retaining contestable source references. Public address exposure requires scoped restriction but never removal of provenance. New appeal evidence reopens only dependent findings and preserves the original disposition. Keep reviewer disposition separate from the recommendation.
